    },
    {
      "start": 95.97,
      "dur": 1.87,
      "text": "would be really heavily scrutinized"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.84,
      "dur": 2.4,
      "text": "in a very sort of specific and custom"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.24,
      "dur": 2.17,
      "text": "way to that particular observation."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.41,
      "dur": 0.93,
      "text": "But I think there are also"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.34,
      "dur": 1.13,
      "text": "some general principles"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.47,
      "dur": 0.73,
      "text": "that we can follow."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.2,
      "dur": 1.57,
      "text": "And the first is just:"
    },
    {
      "start": 106.77,
      "dur": 1.33,
      "text": "Are we sure we're seeing what we think"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.11,
      "dur": 0.97,
      "text": "we're seeing?"
    },
    {
      "start": 109.07,
      "dur": 1.13,
      "text": "Many of these environments"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.2,
      "dur": 1.47,
      "text": "are not very well known to us,"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.67,
      "dur": 1.63,
      "text": "and so we need to convince ourselves"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.31,
      "dur": 1.67,
      "text": "that we're actually seeing a clear signal"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.97,
      "dur": 1.07,
      "text": "that represents"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.04,
      "dur": 1.57,
      "text": "what we think it represents."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.61,
      "dur": 0.7,
      "text": "Carl Sagan"
    },
    {
      "start": 118.31,
      "dur": 0.8,
      "text": "once said, “life"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.11,
      "dur": 2.27,
      "text": "is the hypothesis of last resort,”"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.37,
      "dur": 1.73,
      "text": "meaning that we ought to work hard"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.11,
      "dur": 1.37,
      "text": "for such a claim to rule out"
    },
    {
      "start": 124.47,
      "dur": 1.8,
      "text": "alternative possibilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.27,
      "dur": 1.73,
      "text": "So what are those possibilities?"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.01,
      "dur": 1.83,
      "text": "One is contamination."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.84,
      "dur": 1.5,
      "text": "The spacecraft and the instruments"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.34,
      "dur": 0.57,
      "text": "that we use"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.91,
      "dur": 0.47,
      "text": "to look for"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.37,
      "dur": 0.8,
      "text": "evidence of life"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.17,
      "dur": 1.93,
      "text": "are built in an environment, Earth,"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.11,
      "dur": 1.07,
      "text": "that is full of life."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.17,
      "dur": 1.53,
      "text": "And so we need to convince ourselves"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.71,
      "dur": 1.27,
      "text": "that what we're seeing"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.97,
      "dur": 1.5,
      "text": "is not evidence of our own life,"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.47,
      "dur": 2.2,
      "text": "but evidence of indigenous life."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.67,
      "dur": 0.83,
      "text": "If that's the case,"
    },
    {
      "start": 143.51,
      "dur": 1.07,
      "text": "we should ask,"
    },
    {
      "start": 144.57,
      "dur": 1.17,
      "text": "should life of the type"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.74,
      "dur": 2.17,
      "text": "we're seeing live there?"
    },
    {
      "start": 147.91,
      "dur": 0.9,
      "text": "And finally,"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.81,
      "dur": 0.9,
      "text": "we need to ask,"
    },
    {
      "start": 149.71,
      "dur": 1.4,
      "text": "is there any other way than life"
    },
    {
      "start": 151.11,
      "dur": 0.97,
      "text": "to make that thing,"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.07,
      "dur": 1.33,
      "text": "any of the possible"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.41,
      "dur": 2.0,
      "text": "abiotic processes that we know"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.41,
      "dur": 1.6,
      "text": "and even the ones that we don't know?"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.01,
      "dur": 0.97,
      "text": "And as you can imagine,"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.97,
      "dur": 1.3,
      "text": "that will be quite a challenge."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.27,
      "dur": 1.63,
      "text": "Once we have a piece of evidence"
    },
    {
      "start": 160.91,
      "dur": 1.07,
      "text": "in hand that we really do"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.97,
      "dur": 1.13,
      "text": "think represents"
    },
    {
      "start": 163.11,
      "dur": 1.3,
      "text": "evidence of life,"
    },
    {
      "start": 164.41,
      "dur": 2.2,
      "text": "now we can begin to develop hypotheses."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.61,
      "dur": 0.77,
      "text": "For example,"
    },
    {
      "start": 167.38,
      "dur": 1.5,
      "text": "do we have separate independent"
    },
    {
      "start": 168.88,
      "dur": 1.87,
      "text": "lines of evidence that corroborate"
    },
    {
      "start": 170.74,
      "dur": 1.0,
      "text": "what we've seen"
    },
    {
      "start": 171.74,
      "dur": 2.6,
      "text": "and increase our confidence of life?"
    },
    {
      "start": 174.34,
      "dur": 0.67,
      "text": "Ultimately,"
    },
    {
      "start": 175.01,
      "dur": 1.73,
      "text": "all of this has to be looked at hard"
    },
    {
      "start": 176.74,
      "dur": 1.7,
      "text": "by the entire scientific community,"
    },
    {
      "start": 178.44,
      "dur": 0.6,
      "text": "and in that sense,"
    },
    {
      "start": 179.04,
      "dur": 2.4,
      "text": "I think the really operative word in our question"
    },
    {
      "start": 181.44,
      "dur": 1.03,
      "text": "is we."
    },
    {
      "start": 182.47,
      "dur": 1.1,
      "text": "What does it take to say"
    },
    {
      "start": 183.57,
